 Disc 3: Photo: SOS, The Roundhouse, London, October 1974 by [...]. Disc 4: Photo: Elvin Jones & Alan Skidmore, MPS Studios, Villinghen, September 1978 by [...]. Disc 5: Photo: Alan Skidmore''s Ubizu, Ronnie Scott''s, London, 2003. Disc 6: Photo: Alan Skidmore Quartet + Ed Jones & Howard Cottle, CafA� OTO, 17 July 2019 by [...].  All tracks previously unreleased, except:  "Wednesday Night Prayer Meeting" "Honesty" [url=https://www.discogs.com/artist/425700-Blues-Incorporated]Alexis Korner Blues Incorporated[/url] [r=3982889] ([url=https://www.discogs.com/label/96810-Spot]Spot Records[/url], 1966)  "Nature Boy" "I Remember Clifford" "After the Rain" [a253702] [url=https://www.discogs.com/release/11680041-Alan-Skidmore-Radio-Philharmonie-Hannover-Des-NDR-Colin-Towns-Mask-Symphonic-After-The-Rain-A-Collec]After the Rain[/url] ([l46000], 2008)  "Africa" [url=https://www.discogs.com/artist/2196276-Alan-Skidmores-Ubizo]Alan Skidmore''s Ubizu[/url] [r=2817616] ([l104765], 2008)  "Impressions" "Jumpin'' with Symphony Sid" [a2746328] [url=https://www.discogs.com/release/8272664-Georgie-Fame-Uschi-Br%C3%BCning-Alan-Skidmore-Quartet-A-Declaration-Of-Love]A Declaration of Love[/url] ([url=https://www.discogs.com/label/907700-ITM-ARCHIVES]ITM[/url], 2015)  a?? Confront Recordings 2023', '"Jazz"', '["Contemporary Jazz","Modal","Free Improvisation","Afro-Cuban Jazz","Big Band","Fusion","Free Jazz"]', '2023-05-04T07:00:08-07:00', '2024-01-28T10:00:26-08:00', NULL, NULL, 'https://www.discogs.com/release/26972789-Alan-Skidmore-A-Supreme-Love', 'https://i.discogs.com/I6QciiV-EfE8MnPXD_LNHrc3ApVjRx2OiuvchSkBetE/rs:fit/g:sm/q:40/h:150/w:150/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9SLTI2OTcy/Nzg5LTE2ODQ2ODAz/MTMtOTk4MS5qcGVn.jpeg', '[{"name":"GZ Media","catno":"","entity_type":"10","entity_type_name":"Manufactured By","id":430654,"resource_url":"https://api.discogs.com/labels/430654","thumbnail_url":"https://i.discogs.com/tsQO8Fa5vPMtcFal_YMkjrAm8fO6g9lwwTSN64t0mo8/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:600